1. Notice. This license and the copyright notice above are included in all copies and substantial portions of the Software.

2. Protected values. No copy, fork or derived work that is distributed or run for others may change, remove, replace or bypass:
   a. the network identifier: the network ids in packages/arena-protocol/src/genesis-ids.js, the genesis parameters they are
      computed from, and any network id the authors publish later, such as mainnet's;
   b. the original protocol developers: the network's donation set (the protocol developers' share of every round), the donation
      authority and recovery keys that sign it, and the rule that every round pays the network's donation set in force.
   A fork stays on the same network and pays the original protocol developers. Their donation set changes only by updates signed
   with the donation authority key, as the protocol provides. A game's own donation set belongs to that game's developers.

